      "headline": "Ecology as Living Wisdom",
      "body": "Ecoliteracy requires learning the operating principles developed by natural ecosystems over 3.8 billion years: cycling matter, thriving on solar energy, valuing cooperation, embracing diversity, and maintaining dynamic balance.",
