      "headline": "Symbiogenesis: Evolution by Partnership",
      "body": "Lynn Margulis revolutionized evolutionary biology by demonstrating that complex eukaryotic cells did not evolve solely through predatory competition, but through symbiotic mergers.\nOur mitochondria were once autonomous bacteria that formed mutualistic pacts with host cells.",
